System libraries
  The libraries also load libraries that are part of the operating system
  and are not shipped in the kit: on macOS the system frameworks and
  libiconv; on Windows the Windows system DLLs; on Linux glibc, libstdc++,
  zlib, Fontconfig, libva, libdrm, libEGL, libpulse and libasound. A
  Linux application package that copies any of those into its bundle takes
  on their license terms as well.

Replacing the LGPL libraries
----------------------------

libmpv and the FFmpeg libraries are separate shared libraries loaded at run
time. To use a modified version, rebuild them from the sources archive with
the included scripts (see README.md) and replace the files with the same names
in the application bundle.
